contents = "What’s UP with it! Gang I’m gonna need a HUGE order of your best. I got an important red carpet list of guests coming to that island, yknow? So gimme the works. Vodka, tequila, brandy, whisky, blah blah blah.The usual elevated up to an 11, ya hear?

You should know based on the previous parties. Something strong, another refined, and another one sweet. This time though, there needs to be one strong enough to get people to drop dead drunk, preferably 2 drinks in. Also get that cognac or whatever, Will likes that stuff.

It needs to be enough to last a week, and provide some bartenders too. Only experienced ones this time, ain’t got no time for rookies to freak out this time, it’s gonna be especially wild…

I’ll send over a blank check and some of my office to handle the boring logistics and transaction, they got the details.

Pleasure doing business once again,
Tucker out.
"
